<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus repo yield rises to 4.58 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus repo yield rises to 4.58 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield of a repo auction held between Cyprus's central bank and commercial banks was 4.58 percent on Monday, just above the 4.56 yield at the previous auction on May 5, the bank said.</p>
<p>Yields for the 63 million pounds ($124 million) worth of bills sold ranged from 4.43 percent to 4.72 percent. Bids totalled 76.5 million pounds. ($=0.507 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
